.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-peer 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-peer \- Manage trusted devices
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry peer\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage trusted devices
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ferry\-peer\-add(1)
Add a device by TICKET or Node ID and send it a pairing request
.TP
ferry\-peer\-list(1)
List trusted devices
.TP
ferry\-peer\-edit(1)
Change the alias or Auto\-Accept setting of a device
.TP
ferry\-peer\-verify(1)
Show the safety number shared with a trusted device, to compare it with the other device; `\-\-confirm` records that both match
.TP
ferry\-peer\-remove(1)
Remove a trusted device
